I can't see much interaction based on commit history, but using reflection to look for `IsByRefLike` appears to be a correct approach based on CI runs.

"Expose IsByRefLike api" - https://github.com/dotnet/corefx/pull/23659
"Adding System\Runtime\CompilerServices\IsByRefLikeAttribute type" - https://github.com/dotnet/coreclr/pull/11369

